<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:55:43 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>英国警方逮捕了五名男子，他们涉嫌准备对美国轰炸机用于伊朗战争的基地发动恐怖袭击</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/british-police-arrest-raf-fairford-terrorism-attack-explosives-us-air-force-bombers-iran-war/</link><description>英国皇家空军费尔福德基地位于伦敦以西约 100 英里处，是美国空军根据 20 世纪 50 年代签订的协议使用的英国几个基地之一。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26270356408001-e1790521035690.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:04:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/british-police-arrest-raf-fairford-terrorism-attack-explosives-us-air-force-bombers-iran-war/</guid></item><item><title>特拉维斯·卡兰尼克回归：被赶下台的 Uber 创始人如何从贱民变成硅谷英雄</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/travis-kalanick-uber-comeback-atoms-ai-robotics-cloud-kitchens-silicon-valley/</link><description>这位 Uber 联合创始人带着价值数十亿美元的机器人和人工智能企业回归，而科技行业也更容易接受他的强硬态度。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Travis-Kalanick-social-image.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/travis-kalanick-uber-comeback-atoms-ai-robotics-cloud-kitchens-silicon-valley/</guid></item><item><title>由于能源价格飙升对企业造成打击，法国推出了新的 5 亿美元援助计划，包括帮助支付通勤和取暖费用</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/energy-prices-businesses-france-500-million-aid-package-commuting-heating-costs/</link><description>自 2 月 28 日伊朗战争爆发以来，燃油价格飙升，给欧洲各地的小企业带来沉重打击。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296465270-e1790519024459.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:31:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/energy-prices-businesses-france-500-million-aid-package-commuting-heating-costs/</guid></item><item><title>阿拉斯加政治中最尖锐的侮辱之一是殴打带有“Lower 48”标签的人——这对美国参议院竞选至关重要</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/alaska-politics-lower-48-insult-us-senate-race-dan-sullivan-mary-peltola/</link><description>这个贬义标签反映了阿拉斯加的神秘感，外人通常将其称为“最后的边疆”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26268645101717-e1790518317203.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:21:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/alaska-politics-lower-48-insult-us-senate-race-dan-sullivan-mary-peltola/</guid></item><item><title>正如人工智能巨头警告存在风险一样，他们也可以通过安全来建立竞争护城河。 “这是天才，他们都会赚很多钱”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/ai-giants-openai-sam-altman-anthropic-dario-amodei-existential-risk-humanity-competitive-moat-safety/</link><description>Pitchbook 高级研究分析师哈里森·罗尔夫斯 (Harrison Rolfes) 表示，人工智能巨头可以通过将自己定位为投资者最安全的选择来阻止较小竞争对手的增长。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26266692157613-e1790517322619.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:04:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/ai-giants-openai-sam-altman-anthropic-dario-amodei-existential-risk-humanity-competitive-moat-safety/</guid></item><item><title>婴儿潮一代正在与千禧一代摊牌，就地养老并投入数十万翻修房屋</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/baby-boomers-millennials-mortgage-rates-aging-in-place-renovations/</link><description>千禧一代需要房屋，但由于房价和抵押贷款利率高企，婴儿潮一代没有理由出售房屋。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/GettyImages-2174889879-e1741379829956.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 13:16:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/baby-boomers-millennials-mortgage-rates-aging-in-place-renovations/</guid></item><item><title>前 Meta 高管表示，马克·扎克伯格教会了他如何平衡工作与生活。现在，他在价值 10 亿美元的税务公司对会议和电子邮件制定了严格的规定</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/ex-meta-exec-says-mark-zuckerberg-taught-lesson-work-life-balance-strict-rules-meetings-emails-1-billion-tax-firm/</link><description>在 Meta 工作多年后，马丁·奥特 (Martin Ott) 向马克·扎克伯格 (Mark Zuckerberg) 学习了如何更聪明地工作而不是更长时间地工作：“要确保你不是 24/7 不间断地工作，而是要深思熟虑。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2173579376-e1789984388988.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 13:13:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/ex-meta-exec-says-mark-zuckerberg-taught-lesson-work-life-balance-strict-rules-meetings-emails-1-billion-tax-firm/</guid></item><item><title>Uber首席执行官表示，“要求非常高”的工作文化包括要求员工在周末回复电子邮件：“如果你想随波逐流，就不要来这里”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/uber-ceo-dara-khosrowshahi-really-demanding-work-culture-includes-expecting-employees-answer-emails-over-weekend-dont-come-here-if-you-want-to-coast/</link><description>Uber 老板达拉·科斯罗萨西 (Dara Khosrowshahi) 表示，生活中最重要的技能就是努力工作：“我不会让任何人比我更努力。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/GettyImages-2251581129-e1772640781416.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 13:09:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/uber-ceo-dara-khosrowshahi-really-demanding-work-culture-includes-expecting-employees-answer-emails-over-weekend-dont-come-here-if-you-want-to-coast/</guid></item><item><title>安永全球副主席：人工智能最大的悖论在于人工智能不能做什么</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/ai-fluency-human-judgment-leadership/</link><description>随着人工智能实现工作自动化，人类判断力成为公司最需要的技能。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ey-julie-teigland-2025-meta-e1790097871145.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/ai-fluency-human-judgment-leadership/</guid></item><item><title>她的学校屏蔽了 ChatGPT。现在，这位 17 岁的高中生经营着一家拥有 1,000 名用户的人工智能初创公司</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/17-year-old-ai-founder-banned-in-school/</link><description>Navya Tuteja 的学校 WiFi 屏蔽了 ChatGPT 和 Claude：“这让我在学校使用它的次数减少了……虽然很烦人，但在某种程度上它仍然很好。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_6635.jpeg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/27/17-year-old-ai-founder-banned-in-school/</guid></item></channel></rss>